{"id":"vod_md_6467","vodId":"6467","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"圣女魔力无所不能第二季","name_cn":"圣女魔力无所不能第二季","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231102-1/6a462a851c28b1ff8783a6e3acc243cd.jpg"},"summary":"二十余岁的公司职员圣某天突然作为「圣女」被召唤到了异世界。 她发挥自己原本对植物的爱好，在药用植物研究所展开了工作，但工作狂特有的一本正经加上“圣女之力”使得她不断做出药效提升五成的药水。 另外，她还在讨伐魔物时发动了威力惊人的净化魔法，人望急剧上升！ 「圣女」身份得到了正式承认，她作为斯兰塔尼亚王国的救世主，得到了人们的尊敬。照看并支持她的是研究所的约翰和裘德、宫廷魔导师团的尤里，以及与她互相吸引却仍未成为恋人的“冰封骑士”阿尔伯特。圣成为王国最重要的人物后依旧一心投身于研究，但在与阿尔伯特加深关系的同时，恋爱方面也有了新的进展——？！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-20 01:04:08","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/OERC4j62/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/t1m9YBLL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/pPXzkYcs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/BbLR0nHx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/rkVujkA4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231109/mQi2rUu3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231114/10Uxq97s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231121/LBd2RNZo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231128/Q0Y1ekBm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231206/pqxIfwZU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231212/jDItCIeC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231219/uRtE2qCa/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:36.635Z"}